SUMMARY:Run Wild through Southbank
DESCRIPTION:Experience the energy of Brisbane Festival while building your 
 running fitness on scenic routes through South Bank and the surrounding ri
 verfront precinct. Improve endurance\, pacing and running technique as you
  explore promenades\, parklands and city pathways\, taking in iconic views
  of the Brisbane River and skyline. Suitable for beginner to intermediate 
 runners.
